# ── Private data: NEVER commit ─────────────────────────────
privatedata/
*.bmp
*.BMP
docs/initial-prompt.md
docs/dino3-methods.md
setenv.sh

# ── Reference papers: third-party PDFs, read locally and cited, never vendored ──
# A conference PDF is megabytes of someone else's copyrighted typesetting. Methods
# ported from one cite it by title and authors in the handbook; the file itself stays
# out. check-repo-safety.sh would reject most of them on size alone -- this keeps the
# folder from being staged in the first place.
/papers/

# ── Public reference datasets: too large to commit, freely available ───────
# Anchored with a leading slash, and it matters: an unanchored `datasets` matches
# at *any* depth, which silently ignored `backend/src/anomaly_lab/datasets/` —
# the import-adapter package. New adapters were invisible to git with no error
# anywhere. See README for how to obtain these datasets and their licences.
/datasets/
# The anchoring leaves one real gap, found the hard way: anomalib resolves its penalty
# set against a *relative* `datasets/imagenette`, so a module built without an explicit
# `imagenet_dir` drops 1.2 GB into whatever the working directory happens to be. The bug
# that did that is fixed; this is the guard, because the next one will not announce itself.
/backend/datasets/

# ── App-managed runtime state (DB, artifacts, thumbnails) ──
data/
results/

# ── SQLite ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-journal
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-shm
*.db

# ── Model artifacts (belt-and-braces; normally under data/) ─
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.safetensors

# ── Python ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
build/
/site/

# ── Node / Vite ────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
frontend/dist/
.vite/
npm-debug.log*

# ── Rust / Tauri ───────────────────────────────────────────
frontend/src-tauri/target/
frontend/src-tauri/gen/schemas/
deployment/runner/target/

# ── macOS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
.AppleDouble

# ── Editors / local env ────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
.env
.env.*
*.local
.claude/settings.local.json
# Agent worktrees: whole checkouts, created and removed by the tooling.
.claude/worktrees/
